  "conclusion": "Upper header699,8 is technically bound to shopTicket=QQTTicket, but the original raster explicitly labels it 酷比宝石, so the correct project caption is 灵玉. Lower679,32 uses sugar from getMoney(), original raster QQ糖币 -> 灵币. Variable names alone do not identify display currency. QB payment radio/deposit controls are a separate explicit Q币 category; their original currency label is retained in this art batch because callback/URL/payment values are unchanged. No 仙券 currency is introduced.",
  "nativeRuntimeVerified": false,
  "originalRasterObservation": {
    "file": "assets/native-client-ui/core-reference/frames/bg_shop-000.png",
    "sha256": "1094fbc58ad0243648833059a4b77071342956b0bd5c746bc7a9ce5637b7dfc7",
    "actuallyViewed": true,
    "upperBakedCaption": "酷比宝石",
    "lowerBakedCaption": "QQ糖币",
    "upperProjectCaption": "灵玉",
    "lowerProjectCaption": "灵币"
  },
  "incorrectInferenceWithdrawn": "Earlier inference that QQTTicket meant shopping coupon or made the upper 灵玉 caption wrong is withdrawn; the original raster gives contrary direct semantic evidence."
}
